  "reflectionQuestion": "Have you ever watched someone leave — and felt not grief but joy?",
  "reflectionText": "Jesus led them out to Bethany. He lifted his hands and blessed them. While he was blessing them, he was parted from them and carried up. They watched him go. Then they returned to Jerusalem with great joy. Not grief. Joy. He was gone from their sight. What is it to be the one whose loss has been turned into worship by the way the blessing was given?",
